==Battleground==
*1 [[Queen B]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*9 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage does not differ much from the original stage. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] will likely deal with each Bakoo with ease. The Wicked Tank Cat can be an issue, but it spawns late enough to not immediately cause a loss. Oldhorn falls under this spectrum as well. Regardless, it is still ideal to bring [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic Cats]] to handle the Oldhorn.

